<title>USA: Milton School Dist, Wis., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Milton School Dist, Wis., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust said it won $4.180 million of Milton School District, Wis., general obligation refunding bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.97 percent.</p>
</text>
